"顶部菜单 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 设置 / 书签 / 每条书签的最大行数"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4055-6
