"顶部菜单 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 导出高亮 / 选择文件格式及服务商"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4096-6
