"底部菜单 / <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"bottom_fit.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4207-6
msgid ""
"With this option KOReader tries to crop margins from your document so text "
"can look bigger on your screen. You can set <span class=\"ui\">fit</span> to "
"<span class=\"ui\">width</span> in the same menu which will try to fit only "
"page width instead of whole page, so your text will look bigger."
msgstr ""
"使用此选项，KOReader 会尝试从文档中裁剪边距，以便文本在屏幕上看起来更大。你可"
"以在同一菜单中设置<span class=\"ui\">适配</span>到<span class=\"ui\">宽度</"
"span>，该菜单将尝试仅适合页面宽度而不是整个页面，因此你的文本看起来会更大。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4213-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<b>3. You can try to use your device in </b><span class=\"ui\">Landscape "
#| "orientation</span>"
msgid ""
"<b>3. You can try to use your device in</b><span class=\"ui\">Landscape "
"orientation</span>"
msgstr "<b>3. 将阅读设备设置为</b><span class=\"ui\">横屏模式</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4215-6
msgid ""
"This will make your screen wider so your document may look big enough to "
"read comfortably."
msgstr "这将使你的屏幕更宽，以便你的文档看起来足够大，可以舒适地阅读。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4217-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+pdfs.div:39-0"
msgid "BOTTOM MENU /"
msgstr "底部菜单 /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4221-6
msgid ""
"4. You can zoom to 100 percent size and instead scroll the screen to read "
"different parts"
msgstr "4、以文档原始尺寸浏览，通过滚动屏幕浏览页面的不同部分"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4223-6
msgid ""
"This is especially helpful with comic books. First enable <span "
"class=\"ui\">column mode</span> from this menu item:"
msgstr ""
"这对阅读漫画书尤其有帮助。请先通过该菜单项启用<span class=\"ui\">分栏模式</"
"span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4226-6
