#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7672-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "KOReader can control your device"
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:ts-androidreset"
msgid "Resetting KOReader on Android devices"
msgstr "KOReader 可以控制你的设备"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7674-6
msgid ""
"On Android OS devices, KOReader keeps its settings under the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Internal Storage/koreader/</span> directory. This is an "
"intentional behavior which is different from other Android applications. "
"This location allows you to backup and synchronize your KOReader settings "
"easily by saving them under this user-accessible directory."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7677-6
msgid ""
"But when you uninstall KOReader or clear its data from the <b>Android OS "
"Settings</b> menu, this KOReader settings directory <b>is not removed</b>. "
"So if you uninstall KOReader and then install it again, it will start with "
"your old settings."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7680-6
msgid ""
"If you want to completely reset KOReader to its factory defaults, you should "
"delete this directory manually. When you start KOReader after deleting this "
"directory, it will be automatically re-created with the <b>default settings</"
"b>."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7683-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:ts-disableads"
msgid "Disabling ads on Amazon Kindle devices"
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7685-6
msgid ""
"This is technically possible, but unfortunately we can't change the "
"<b>default sleep screen behavior</b> on these readers. Because this might "
"trigger a negative reaction from Amazon, which might lock down the Kindle "
"ecosystem (no more KOReader for Kindles) or even endanger the whole project "
"(no more KOReader). For further info, you can check this discussion with our "
"developers <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/issues/"
"14098\">here</a>. Our stance is in line with the <b>MobileRead</b> forums' "
"stance which you can read <a href=\"https://www.mobileread.com/forums/"
"showthread.php?t=200942\">here</a>."
msgstr ""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7689-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "I see small numbers on the side when reading a book"
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:ts-publishernumbers"
msgid "Small numbers on the side when reading"
msgstr "看书时，我看到侧面有小数字"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7690-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Those small numbers are called <b>Reference Page Numbers</b>. In short, "
#| "they are the real page numbers from the printed version of your book. For "
#| "more information please click here <a href=\"#L2-readingscreen\">Reading "
#| "Screen</a> to go to the relevant section."
msgid ""
"Those small numbers are called <b>publisher page numbers</b>. In short, they "
"are the real page numbers from the printed version of your book. For more "
"information please click here <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-"
"pagenumbering\">Page Numbering</a> to go to the relevant section."
msgstr ""
"这些小数字称为<b>参考页码</b>。简而言之，它们是你的书的印刷版的真实页码。有关"
"详细信息，请单击此处<a href=\"#L2-readingscreen\">阅读屏幕</a>转至相关部分。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7693-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:ts-statusbardisappear"
msgid "My status bar disappeared"
msgstr "我的状态栏消失了"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7695-6
msgid ""
"Probably you tapped on the <span class=\"ui\">STATUS BAR</span> touch zone "
"at the bottom of the screen. You can bring it back by tapping the same zone."
msgstr ""
"可能你点击了屏幕底部的<span class=\"ui\">状态栏</span>。你可以通过轻触同一区"
"域将其恢复。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7698-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:ts-indentation"
msgid "Text indentation problems"
msgstr "文本缩进问题"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7700-6
msgid ""
"If you get miscentered titles, headings or separators, or unexpected text "
"indentation, try switching the style for your document. <span "
"class=\"ui\">epub.css</span> to <span class=\"ui\">html5.css</span>. This "
"kind of problems happen because some publishers assume their books will only "
"be read on <b>web browser engine based</b> readers, so they don't bother "
"\"resetting\" the styles."
msgstr ""
"如果标题、小标题或分隔符没有正确居中，或者出现意外的文本缩进，请尝试切换文档"
"的样式，把 <span class=\"ui\">epub.css</span> 改成 <span "
"class=\"ui\">html5.css</span>。发生这种问题是因为一些出版方认为他们的书只会在"
"<b>基于网络浏览器引擎的</b>阅读器上阅读，因此他们不会费心“重置”样式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7704-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:24px;\"> / Style"
msgstr ""
"顶部菜单 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:24px;\"> / 样式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:7708-7
msgid ""
"Default <span class=\"ui\">HTML/EPUB (epub.css)</span> is our book-oriented "
"stylesheet, with <b>text-align: justify, text-indent on P</b>. It is better "
"for unstyled books, and might make styled books more readable."
msgstr ""
"默认 <span class=\"ui\">HTML/EPUB (epub.css)</span> 是我们面向书籍的样式表，"
"带有 <b>text-align: justify, text-indent on P</b>。它更适合无样式的书籍，并且"
"可能会使具有样式的书籍更具可读性。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:7711-7
msgid ""
"You can try switching to <span class=\"ui\">HTML5 (html5.css)</span> if your "
"book has indentation problems as mentioned above. This style provides a base "
"stylesheet like web browsers do when rendering: <b>text-align: left, no text-"
"indent on P, spacing between P</b>. But it doesn’t look pretty when "
"publishers haven’t done any styling."
msgstr ""
"如果您的书籍存在上述缩进问题，您可以尝试切换到 <span class=\"ui\">HTML5 "
"(html5.css)</span>，这种样式提供了一个基本样式表，就像 Web 浏览器在渲染时所做"
"的那样： <b>text-align: left, no text-indent on P, spacing between P</b>。但"
"是当出版方没有做任何样式时，它看起来并不漂亮。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7715-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Cleaning your book cover cache database"
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:ts-clearingcovercache"
msgid "Clearing book cover cache database"
msgstr "删除书籍封面缓存数据库"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7717-6
msgid ""
"KOReader keeps a cache of your book covers to be able to show them quicker. "
"In normal conditions this cache doesn’t get too big. If you remove lots of "
"books or rename directories, you may want to clean up your book cover cache "
"database to reclaim some space. You can do it from this menu:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 会缓存书籍封面以更快地显示。在正常情况下该缓存不会占用过多空间。在删"
"除大量书籍或对文件夹重命名后，可能需要删除书籍封面缓存数据库以回收一些空间。"
"该操作可通过下列菜单中执行："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7719-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU (in File Browser) / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Mosaic and detailed "
"list settings / Book info cache management"
msgstr ""
"（文件管理器中的）顶部菜单 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / 设置 / 陈列及详情视图设置 / 书籍信"
"息缓存管理"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7722-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:ts-clearingfilecache"
msgid "Clearing file cache"
msgstr "删除文件缓存"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7723-6
msgid ""
"When you are reading a <b>PDF/DJVU</b> document, KOReader keeps a cache of "
"the last page you have read. So when you reopen the book, it will be faster. "
"But this cache can grow big if you are using KOReader for a long time and "
"reading many PDF/DJVU documents. These cache files are kept under your "
"KOReader installation directory under the <b>cache folder</b>. To clear this "
"cache and reclaim the space you can go to:"
msgstr ""
"当您阅读 <b>PDF/DJVU</b> 文档时，KOReader 会保留您阅读的最后一页的缓存。所以"
"当你重新打开这本书时，它会更快。但是，如果您长时间使用 KOReader 并阅读许多 "
"PDF/DJVU 文档，则此缓存可能会变大。这些缓存文件保存在 KOReader 安装目录下的"
"<b>缓存文件夹</b>下。要删除此缓存并回收空间，您可以转到："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7726-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU (in file browser) / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_tools.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / More tools / Developer options / "
"Clear caches"
msgstr ""
"（文件管理器中的）顶部菜单 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_tools.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / 更多工具 / 开发者选项 / 删除缓存"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7729-6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<span class=\"label_red\">WARNING</span> Clear this cache <b>only if you "
